cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: LST-AI Lesion Segmentation
abstract: Segments white-matter hyperintensities (MS-type lesions) from paired T1w and FLAIR volumes with
  LST-AI, an ensemble of three 3D U-Nets, on a GPU or CPU. Writes a binary lesion mask and probability
  map per subject plus lesion volume and count tables.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-lst-ai
license: Apache-2.0
